                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game looks very nice, and it definitely has potential. However, this is ruined by the lack of players, and lack of any kind of balancing in multiplayer. The only person online when I played set his height very low apparently, so he was a tiny floating dude with long arms. The grenade launcher is an instant kill, and has no cooldown, so this was all that he used. This makes the experience straight up not fun. \n\nThere's so much potential, and gorgeous graphics, so it's a pity that the multiplayer is implemented the way it is.",
